Z||000003||Spyder||05-11-2000||12:58 PM||||SpeedPhreak<BR>Balls To The Walls Man!!!<P>I just learned how to ride on a friends motorcycle, and I’m glad I have the fear to live.<BR>I would have killed myself when I was younger.<BR>I like the custom bikes and choppers, don’t care much about the Harleys , too much hype.<BR>I would like to get a crouch rocket or a chopper. I like the bad arse attitude that you get when you ride.||||reg||1
